    triggered: { title: "Triggered — Day One",   brief: "Name the craving for what it is — the addiction's strongest move, timed for the hardest moment. Tell them a craving is not a command. Walk them through it: the feeling rises, peaks, and fades whether they act on it or not. Ask them to get through the next 20 minutes. Change location if they can." },
