    anxious:   { title: "Anxious — Day Five",    brief: "By Day Five, anxiety is often about what comes next — how to stay sober in ordinary life. Help them focus back on just today. They don't need a plan for the next six months. They need to get through today. Ask them what one thing they're dreading and help them make it smaller." },
    triggered: { title: "Triggered — Day Five",  brief: "Five days in and still getting triggered — that's normal. Tell them the brain's reward circuits are still firing the old patterns. What matters is the gap between the urge and acting on it — and that gap is already wider than it was on Day One." },
