    anxious:   { title: "Anxious — Day Six",     brief: "By Day Six, anxiety often starts to attach to specific triggers — places, people, times of day associated with using. Help them name one of those triggers and think about what they can do differently when they encounter it. Preparation reduces the power of the trigger." },
