    triggered: { title: "Triggered — Day Seventeen", brief: "Loneliness is one of the most powerful and least-named triggers in recovery. Is this craving about the substance, or about the isolation using used to temporarily relieve? If it's loneliness, the answer is contact with another person, not willpower." },
