    triggered: { title: "Triggered — Day Twenty-Seven", brief: "Three days from a month and a craving hits. Tell them this is the pattern — the hardest moments come at the highest stakes. They've been here before. They know it passes. The craving is losing this one, same as it has twenty-six times before." },
